        "created_at": "2020-06-16T15:08:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Heroes unite against facism!&nbsp; G.I. Bunker, XPW Tempest, Visionary Unleashed, PW Fanatic, and Setting Sun Ra take the fight to Grand Warlord Voss in Megalopolis.&nbsp; Easy mint at 25/13/15/16/24 (and Fanatic would have been 6 higher, but she did an unnecessary Sacrosanct Martyr to finish him off).<br>\n<br>\nThe only thing that really went wrong here was Fanatic blind-playing End of Days to remove my early setup, but it was easy to recover.</p>",
