        "id": 231161,
        "name": "starkenburg_alexander",
        "username": "starkenburg_alexander",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/starkenburg_alexander/{size}/1857_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-06-16T16:04:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint goodness with everyone (except Fanatic) around 10. Fanatic was low because of a Resolute into a 5 damage Sacrosanct Martyr to deal 8 more damage in the final turn.<br>\n<br>\nGI Bunker makes Voss' DR pointless so leaving a minion out to keep him from flipping isn't a terrible idea. I just burned everything that came onto the board anyway and worked him down. Near the end, Tempest got his Cleansing Downpour so I could have slowed down to heal up more if needed but it wasn't. Ra did surprisingly little damage, usually using Flesh of the Sun God instead of his base due to a lack of targets.<br>\n<br>\n~A-Kat</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
