        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/51bf81/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-06-17T20:27:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My first time through, I took long enough that Forced Deployment came out, but Brain Burn took the wind out of those sails.&nbsp; If you play your cards right, you can finish him before the second spaceship comes out (or leat the police finish him off). Prophetic Vision, Embolden, Chastise, Flesh of the Sun God, you have everything you need.&nbsp; And like Mad Dog, I made good use of Wrathful Gaze -- discarding it :-p</p>",
